Date: Mon, 1 Jun 2026 09:12:13 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 726/913] mod/wide: fix scmi clock duty cycle support

SCMI clock duty cycle support is indicated by the extended bit in
the clock attributes and requires SCMI Clock protocol version 3.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 0e9aa5725a2841cd65f317d622dd023468aaa5b9 mod/wide: fix scmi clock duty cycle support]
Change-Id: Ic6967333ea412f681f1944a90356c69ce6b0d2d3
